    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="Prol.">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:VIIIAtr">VIII Atr</ref> Prol.</head>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="ang" source="#liebermann" n="Prol." corresp="#wit-g-a-part">Ðis is an ðæra gerædnessa, þe Engla cyng gedihte mid his witena geðehte.</ab>
        <ab type="editionText" xml:lang="ang" source="#robertson" corresp="#wit-d">Þis is an ðara gerædnessa þe Engla cyningc gedihte mid his witena geþeahte.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#robertson" corresp="#wit-d">This is one of the ordinances which the English king drew up with the advice of his councillors.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="de" source="#liebermann">Prol. Dies ist einer der Beschlüsse, die der König der Engländer mit Beistimmung seiner Witan verordnete.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#claude" ana="#fromGerman">Prologue. This is one of the ordinances which the king of the English decreed with the counsel of his witan.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
